{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】西營盤一座大廈有單位起火，70多歲男子送院後不治。</p><p>男子救出後昏迷，需在擔架上用自動心外壓機急救，由救護車送往瑪麗醫院救治。</p><p>起火單位內熏黑，多名居民疏散到街上。現場是薄扶林道恆輝大廈8樓一個單位，消防夜晚近9時接報單位起火，出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊撲救。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T16:22:13.919141+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:38:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T16:57:38.972727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T16:18:13.383976+00:00","content_hash":"3a5b48b412981f058c17bcc7268fce67c7f8099e0140434cf57161804a95f122","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}